   "type": "calculation",
   "title": "Unlimited full-throttle rpm on a fresh pack and the output cap that respects the APC limit",
   "script": "redesign/team/B4/props.py",
   "function": "rpm_full",
   "equation": "(V - rpm/Kv)/R = Q(rpm)/Kt + I0, cold winding (lowest R, highest rpm), V = max OCV ; cap: find V_eff giving rpm = 0.98 x 105000/D_in ; duty = V_eff / V_ocv,max ; T/W at the cap = 4 T(rpm_cap) / (k_dl m g)",
